        0 ≤ dist x y - ‖PaperN.PartII.distanceDifferenceLp μ (ENNReal.ofReal p) x y‖ ∧
          dist x y - ‖PaperN.PartII.distanceDifferenceLp μ (ENNReal.ofReal p) x y‖ ≤
